---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

import { translationsFor } from '../i18n/routes';
---
<Base
  lang="sr"
  title="Dostava terarijuma i akvarijuma širom Srbije | NS Reptiles"
  description="Informacije o dostavi terarijuma, akvarijuma i opreme. Rokovi isporuke 1–5 dana, kurirska dostava širom Srbije, bezbedno pakovanje staklenih proizvoda."
  path="/dostava.html"
  image="/style/img/logo.jpg"
  ogTitle="Dostava terarijuma i akvarijuma | NS Reptiles"
  ogDescription="Rokovi isporuke 1–5 dana, kurirska dostava širom Srbije, bezbedno pakovanje staklenih proizvoda."
  translations={translationsFor("/dostava.html")}
>
<section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Dostava širom Srbije</h1>
        <p>Pažljivo pakujemo i šaljemo vaše terarijume, akvarijume i opremu - bezbedno, na vreme i do vaše adrese, ma gde u Srbiji bili.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="del">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="dsec-title">
          <h2>Kada stiže <b>vaša porudžbina</b></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="sec-lead">Vreme isporuke zavisi od vrste proizvoda koji poručujete. Evo okvirnih rokova za svaku kategoriju.</p>
        <div class="dcard-grid">
          <div class="dcard">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 00-1-1.7l-7-4a2 2 0 00-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 003 8v8a2 2 0 001 1.7l7 4a2 2 0 002 0l7-4A2 2 0 0021 16z"></path><path d="M3.3 7L12 12l8.7-5M12 22V12"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Po vrsti proizvoda</h3>
            <div class="drow"><span>Oprema, hrana i dekoracije</span><b>1–3 dana</b></div>
            <div class="drow"><span>Terarijumi i akvarijumi sa stanja</span><b>2–5 dana</b></div>
            <div class="drow"><span>Izrada po meri</span><b>7–14 dana</b></div>
            <div class="drow"><span>Životinje</span><b>Lično</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="dcard">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Brza isporuka</h3>
            <p>Većinu opreme i manjih artikala šaljemo već narednog radnog dana od potvrde porudžbine. Radne dane računamo od ponedeljka do petka, bez praznika.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="dcard">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 00-7 7c0 5 7 13 7 13s7-8 7-13a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle></svg></div>
            <h3>Izrada po meri</h3>
            <p>Za terarijume i akvarijume rađene po vašim merama, tačan rok dogovaramo individualno - u zavisnosti od dimenzija, materijala i trenutne zauzetosti radionice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="del">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="dsec-title">
          <h2>Kako <b>dostavljamo</b></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="sec-lead">Dostavu prilagođavamo proizvodu i lokaciji - od standardnih paketa do krhkih staklenih terarijuma kojima treba poseban tretman.</p>
        <div class="methods">
          <div class="method">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"></rect><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z"></path><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg></div>
            <div><h4>Kurirska služba</h4><p>Dostava na adresu širom cele Srbije. Standardna opcija za opremu i manje terarijume.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="method">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 17V6a2 2 0 012-2h12a2 2 0 012 2v11"></path><path d="M2 17h20v2a1 1 0 01-1 1H3a1 1 0 01-1-1z"></path><circle cx="7" cy="20" r="1"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="20" r="1"></circle><path d="M4 8h16"></path></svg></div>
            <div><h4>Autobuska dostava</h4><p>Za veći deo Srbije šaljemo i autobusima - brzo i pouzdano do najbliže stanice.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="method">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 17h14M6 17l1-6h10l1 6M8 11l1-4h6l1 4"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="17.5" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="17.5" r="1.5"></circle><path d="M10 7V5h4v2"></path></svg></div>
            <div><h4>Taksi na adresu (Beograd)</h4><p>Za Beograd nudimo i dostavu taksijem direktno na vašu adresu, za hitne ili krhke pošiljke.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="method">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path><path d="M9 22V12h6v10"></path></svg></div>
            <div><h4>Lično preuzimanje / dostava u NS</h4><p>U Novom Sadu i okolini moguća je lična dostava većih terarijuma, kao i lično preuzimanje po dogovoru.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="del">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="dsec-title">
          <h2>Koliko <b>košta</b></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="sec-lead">Cena zavisi od težine paketa, dimenzija i lokacije. Za krhke staklene proizvode transport računamo posebno.</p>
        <div class="dbanner">
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Standardna oprema i manji terarijumi</h3>
            <p>Za opremu, hranu, dekoracije i manje terarijume cena dostave je fiksna i pristupačna.</p>
            <div class="price-tag"><b>350–700</b><span>din, zavisno od težine i lokacije</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="del-note-card">
            <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"></path></svg></div>
            <h3>Veći terarijumi i akvarijumi</h3>
            <p>Zbog specifičnosti transporta staklenih proizvoda, cenu računamo individualno za svaku porudžbinu. Cenu dostave snosi kupac.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dcta">
          <h3>Imate pitanje o dostavi?</h3>
          <p>Javite nam vrstu proizvoda i vašu lokaciju, pa ćemo vam dati tačan rok i cenu dostave pre nego što poručite.</p>
          <div class="dcta-btns">
            <a href="https://wa.me/381693301474" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">WhatsApp poruka</a>
            <a href="tel:+381693301474" class="btn btn-outline">Pozovi nas</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="useful-links">
          <a href="/kontakt.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"></path></svg>Kontakt</a>
          <a href="/terarijumi.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path><path d="M12 3v6"></path><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="2"></circle></svg>Terarijumi</a>
          <a href="/akvarijumi.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12c2-3 5-5 10-5s8 2 10 5"></path><path d="M2 17c2-3 5-5 10-5s8 2 10 5"></path><path d="M12 22V7"></path><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>Akvarijumi</a>
          <a href="/oprema.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 01-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 01-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 009 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 01-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 004.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 010-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 004.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 009 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 014 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0019.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 010 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z"></path></svg>Oprema</a>
          <a href="/terarijumi.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 20h20"></path><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="1"></rect><path d="M4 10h16"></path><path d="M10 4v16"></path></svg>Izrada terarijuma</a>
          <a href="/akvarijumi.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 15c3-3 6-4 10-4s7 1 10 4"></path><path d="M2 20c3-3 6-4 10-4s7 1 10 4"></path><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="13" rx="1"></rect></svg>Izrada akvarijuma</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<style is:global>
      .del{padding:64px 0 100px;background:var(--bg);transition:background .4s}
      .del+.del{padding-top:0}
      .dsec-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px}
      .dsec-title h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);text-transform:uppercase}
      .dsec-title h2 b{color:var(--green-ink)}
      .sec-lead{text-align:center;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 44px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

      .dcard-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px}
      .dcard{position:relative;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--silver);padding:30px 28px;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s}
      .dcard .ic{position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px;color:var(--green-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
      .dcard h3{font-size:1.12rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}
      .drow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bg);font-size:.94rem}
      .drow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
      .drow span:first-child{color:var(--ink-soft)}
      .drow b{font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-ink);white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}
      .dcard p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem}

      .methods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px}
      .method{position:relative;display:flex;gap:16px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--silver);padding:24px 60px 24px 26px;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s}
      .method .ic{position:absolute;top:20px;right:20px;color:var(--green-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
      .method h4{font-size:1rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px}
      .method p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem}

      .dbanner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px}
      .price-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--silver);padding:30px 28px;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s}
      .price-card h3{font-size:1.12rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}
      .price-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:10px}
      .price-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-top:6px}
      .price-tag b{font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:2rem;color:var(--green-ink);line-height:1}
      .price-tag span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.85rem}
      .del-note-card{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--green),var(--green-dark));color:#fff;padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
      .del-note-card .ic{position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
      .del-note-card h3{color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px}
      .del-note-card p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-size:.95rem}

      .dcta{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--silver);padding:36px 32px;text-align:center;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s}
      .dcta h3{font-size:1.4rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}
      .dcta p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:22px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
      .dcta-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}

      @media(max-width:880px){.dcard-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dbanner{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
      @media(max-width:680px){.methods{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    </style>

</Base>
